# the Froid. Tense and driving: a pulsing low E, a cold bell answering,
# the harmony creeping down a half step at a time.
tempo 128
rows 4

inst pulse square   vol 0.10 duty 0.25 attack 0.002 decay 0.15 sustain 0.0
inst bell  triangle vol 0.11 attack 0.003 decay 0.9 sustain 0.0
inst pad   sine     vol 0.10 attack 0.4 decay 0.8 sustain 0.8 release 0.8 vibrato 0.005
inst bass  sine     vol 0.24 attack 0.01 decay 0.3 sustain 0.3 release 0.2

pattern a
pulse E3 E3 .  E3 | E3 .  E3 E3 | E3 E3 .  E3 | E3 .  G3 F#3
bell  B5 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | G5 .  .  .  | .  .  F#5 .
pad   E4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  E2 .  E2 .  | E2 .  E2 .  | E2 .  E2 .  | E2 .  E2 .

pattern b
pulse C3 C3 .  C3 | C3 .  C3 C3 | B2 B2 .  B2 | B2 .  D#3 F#3
bell  G5 .  .  .  | E5 .  .  .  | F#5 . .  .  | D#5 . .  .
pad   G4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | F#4 . .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  C2 .  C2 .  | C2 .  C2 .  | B1 .  B1 .  | B1 .  B1 .

pattern c
pulse A2 A2 .  A2 | A2 .  C3 E3 | A#2 A#2 . A#2 | A#2 . D3 F3
bell  E6 .  .  C6 | .  .  A5 .  | F6 .  .  D6 | .  .  A#5 .
pad   C4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | D4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  A1 .  A1 .  | A1 .  A1 .  | A#1 . A#1 . | A#1 . A#1 .

order a a b a c b a b
